{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../send_inline_bot_result/", "title": "send_inline_bot_result()"}, "next": {"link": "../send_web_app_custom_request/", "title": "send_web_app_custom_request()"}, "title": "answer_web_app_query()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"answer-web-app-query\">\n<h1>answer_web_app_query()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#answer-web-app-query\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.answer_web_app_query\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">answer_web_app_query</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.answer_web_app_query\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set the result of an interaction with a <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/webapps\">Web App</a> and send a\ncorresponding message on behalf of the user to the chat from which the query originated.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>web_app_query_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 Unique identifier for the answered query.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>result</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/InlineQueryResult/#pyrogram.types.InlineQueryResult\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InlineQueryResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InlineQueryResult</span></code></a>) \u2013 A list of results for the inline query.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/SentWebAppMessage/#pyrogram.types.SentWebAppMessage\" title=\"pyrogram.types.SentWebAppMessage\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SentWebAppMessage</span></code></a> \u2013 On success the sent web app message is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/send_web_app_custom_request", "send_web_app_custom_request()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/send_inline_bot_result", "send_inline_bot_result()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">answer_web_app_query()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.answer_web_app_query\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.answer_web_app_query()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/answer_web_app_query", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}